{"id":"o5","why":"The fitted chocolate blazer and black midi skirt sharpen your shape, while the scarf adds necessary texture for 18°C autumn weather."},
{"id":"o2","why":"A navy blazer and graphite trousers offer a classic smart-casual balance with loafers that ground the relaxed top."},
{"id":"o4","why":"The black midi dress simplifies your morning routine while the wide scarf provides warmth and softens the monochrome silhouette."}
