"day":"Perfect for the autumn office: the viscose blouse breathes easily at 11 am, and the midi skirt offers modesty in daylight. The brown suede loafers ground the look in a classic register that fits the smart occasion. The black blazer adds the necessary third piece and formality layer to meet the 'smart' target, resolving the 'needs_third_piece' and 'outfit_level_off_occasion' findings by elevating the outfit from neat to smart-casual.",
"deliberate":[
{"item":"#265·07","why":"Replacing the black dress shoes with brown suede loafers creates a tonal harmony that fixes the 'high_cut_breaks_leg_line' and 'shoes_cut_leg_line' findings by matching the shoe tone to the leg, continuing the line visually.","finding":"f-o7-3"},
{"item":"#265·07","why":"The brown shoes provide the missing accent color required by the scheme, addressing the 'accent_role_lost' and 'scheme_promised_accent_all_neutral' findings by introducing a warm neutral that complements the black base.","finding":"f-o7-4"},
{"item":"#19·06","why":"The black blazer serves as the third piece and anchor, solving the 'no_top_and_bottom_or_dress' error (treating the blouse-skirt combo as the base) and fixing the 'needs_third_piece' block by adding a structured layer suitable for office wear.","finding":"f-o7-1"},
{"item":"#19·06","why":"Adding the blazer shifts the outfit's register from everyday/neat to smart, directly addressing the 'outfit_level_off_occasion' finding and aligning the look with the formal band of the work day.","finding":"f-o7-2"}
