"day":"A classic office combination: the navy blazer handles the 11 am start in daylight without looking too heavy for 18°C. The graphite trousers provide a modern twist on the wide-leg silhouette, keeping comfort high throughout the day. The terracotta bag adds a pop of color that fits the smart-casual register, and the red kerchief offers a subtle pattern break that aligns with the occasion's formality band.",
"deliberate":[
{"item":"#20·39","why":"The terracotta bag replaces the missing accessory, solving the 'no_bag' block and adding a warm accent that elevates the outfit from basic neutrals to a coordinated look.","finding":"b-o2-1"},
